---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Newsletter privacy | Ekselera"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-40 pb-24"><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Latest Updates newsletter privacy</h1><p class="mt-6">When you subscribe, Ekselera processes your email address, confirmation time, and consent record to send future Latest Updates. Cloudflare hosts our confirmation service and Resend manages email delivery and preferences. We do not automatically subscribe existing contacts or send older posts.</p><p class="mt-6">You can leave this newsletter using the preferences link in every email. A global unsubscribe stops all newsletters in our shared account. We retain minimal consent and suppression records to respect your choices. Contact us through <a class="link" href="/contact/">our contact page</a> to request access or deletion.</p></div></Layout>
